    "body": "Hi, unfortunately like I mentioned I only get this problem on new terminals or after a while in a terminal session, and on the following commands the terminal is responsive as expected, so the output of `starship timings` looks normal.\r\n\r\nI'm assuming the issue is caused by Starship and not other ZSH addons because it does not occur if I switch to powerlevel10k or other themes. \r\n\r\nHere's the output of `starship timings` in a git repository:\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2021-11-04 09-27-06](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/77389987/140281475-8d0bae19-a0d1-4053-b993-9c26a4dcc7e4.png)\r\n",
